    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PO Assistant - Orchestrator\nSingle entry point: every Slack message of a project channel lands here.\nOne channel = one project. The project status stored in Postgres decides which step handles the message.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 420,
        "color": "#F7F7F7"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1700,
        -1900
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "note-note-overview",
      "name": "Note - Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Entry and filtering\nSlack Trigger, then bot messages and message edits/deletions are ignored (avoids loops and empty runs). The project is looked up in Postgres by channel_id.",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1100,
        -1620
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "note-note-entry",
      "name": "Note - Entry"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Routing\nNo project yet: Elevator Pitch sub-workflow.\nStatus pitch_validated: Personas and roles sub-workflow (pitch loaded from Postgres and merged with the Slack message).\nStatus personas_and_roles_validated: User stories (not built yet).\nAny other status: error branch.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -560,
        -1900
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "note-note-routing",
      "name": "Note - Routing"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Error handling\nEvery node retries on failure. After the last retry the user is notified in Slack, then Stop and Error marks the execution as failed so the global Error Workflow alerts the admin.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 420,
        "color": "#11E4C1"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        440,
        -1000
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
